        "trunk_message": "<p>Note — boot mat:</p><p>Up to 140x240 cm — in one piece ✅</p><p>Up to 150x250 cm — in two pieces ✅</p><p>Over 280 cm long — we do not make ❌</p><p>ℹ️ If in doubt, please contact our sales department.</p>",
