        "tab_kAfLU4": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Specifikace",
            "id": "tech",
            "html": "<p class=\"evamats-tab-dup-title\"><strong>🔧 Technical specification</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Material:</strong> High-quality EVA foam (ethylene-vinyl acetate)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Mat thickness:</strong> About 10 mm — the ideal balance of flexibility and durability</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Cell structure:</strong> Diamond (7 mm) / Honeycomb (8 mm) - choose when ordering</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Set weight:</strong> From 1.2 to 2.5 kg (depending on the version)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Number of pieces:</strong> 2–6 pieces (full set: front + rear + boot optional)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Floor coverage:</strong> Up to 95% of the car floor area</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Seasons:</strong> All year round — resistant to temperatures from −50 °C to +50 °C</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Water resistance:</strong> 100% — does not absorb liquids, does not stain</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Fastening:</strong> Plastic clips (original) / hook-and-loop — compatible with factory fixing points</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Edging:</strong> 14 colours to choose from</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Other options:</strong> Reinforced heel pads</li>\n</ul>",
            "hide_on_accessories": false
          }
        },
        "tab_QjEwcm": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Questions and answers",
            "id": "faq",
            "html": "<div class=\"ept-faq\">\n  <details class=\"ept-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"ept-faq__summary\"><span class=\"ept-faq__q\">Floor coverage and fit</span><span class=\"ept-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n    <div class=\"ept-faq__panel\">\n<p><strong>– Will the mats definitely fit?</strong><br>Yes, our EVA mats are designed specifically for every make, model and version, and they cover the whole floor area including places that rubber or velour mats do not protect.</p>\n<p><strong>– What is a tunnel mat?</strong><br>EVA mats cover up to 98% of the floor including the centre tunnel and give maximum protection.</p>\n<p><strong>– Is the heel pad fitted to the driver's mat?</strong><br>No, the heel pad is supplied separately so you can position it to your own preference.</p>\n</div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"ept-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"ept-faq__summary\"><span class=\"ept-faq__q\">Material properties and durability</span><span class=\"ept-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n    <div class=\"ept-faq__panel\">\n<p><strong>– What is EVA material?</strong><br>It is a 10 mm thick foam that traps dirt and water on the surface of the mat and stops them getting underneath.</p>\n<p><strong>– What is the difference between a 3D set and a 3D set with edges?</strong><br>A 3D set with edges gives extra protection to the side trim of the floor and a better fit.</p>\n<p><strong>– How long do the mats last?</strong><br>Thanks to the durable EVA material the mats last 5 to 7 years without signs of wear.</p>\n</div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"ept-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"ept-faq__summary\"><span class=\"ept-faq__q\">Use and care</span><span class=\"ept-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n    <div class=\"ept-faq__panel\">\n<p><strong>– How do I clean EVA mats?</strong><br>Dirt does not cling to the surface of the mat. Just shake it out, or rinse it with a pressure washer if it is heavily soiled.</p>\n<p><strong>– Are EVA mats suitable for summer and winter?</strong><br>Yes, they are water-resistant, odourless, temperature-resistant and ideal for year-round use.</p>\n</div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"ept-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"ept-faq__summary\"><span class=\"ept-faq__q\">Ordering and delivery</span><span class=\"ept-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n    <div class=\"ept-faq__panel\">\n<p><strong>– What is the delivery time?</strong><br>We usually fulfil orders within 2 weeks. For special vehicles such as motorboats or tractors it can extend to 4–6 weeks.</p>\n<p><strong>– How is delivery handled?</strong><br>We send the mats by courier straight to the customer's address. Because of the size of the product we do not send mats to parcel lockers. We make sure they arrive exactly as they were made — without folding or bending that could affect the fit.</p>\n</div>\n  </details>\n</div>",
            "hide_on_accessories": true
          }
        },
        "tab_Eh7cBq": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Doprava a platba",
            "id": "delivery",
            "html": "<p class=\"evamats-tab-dup-title\"><strong>📦 Shipping and payment</strong></p>\n\n<p>We make every EVA mat to order from scratch, with attention to detail and a perfect fit to your specific car model.</p>\n\n<p style=\"border:1px solid #ef022d; padding:10px; border-radius:8px;\">💡 The current standard order processing time is 14 working days.</p>\n\n<p>Choose how fast your order is made</p>\n\n<p>Every set of mats is made individually, so you can choose how quickly your order enters production.</p>\n\n<p>Available production options:</p>\n\n<p>🟢 Standard — 14 working days<br>\nProcessed in the standard production queue.</p>\n\n<p>🟠 Express — 7 working days<br>\nHigher priority in the production queue.</p>\n\n<p>As soon as production is finished, the mats are ready to ship.</p>\n\n<p>You can select priority production on the \"Shipping and payment\" page when choosing the delivery method. Express is available for an extra charge.</p>\n\n<p>🚗 We do our utmost to process orders as fast as possible. In busy periods — seasonal peaks, promotions or holidays — processing may take longer.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Delivery methods:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"product_tabs__containers_item_block\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/7988/1010/files/Frame_427319187.svg?v=1754576315\" alt=\"InPost\"> \n  <ul>\n    <li>InPost courier (online payment or cash on delivery)</li>\n    <li>InPost parcel locker (online payment only)</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product_tabs__containers_item_block\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/7988/1010/files/dpd.svg?v=1754574037\" alt=\"DPD\"> \n  <ul>\n    <li>DPD courier (online payment or cash on delivery)</li>\n    <li>DPD pickup point (online payment only)</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product_tabs__containers_item_block\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0790/9218/7414/files/GLS_Logo_2021_svg.svg?v=1774966899\" alt=\"GLS\"> \n  <ul>\n    <li>GLS courier (online payment or cash on delivery)</li>\n    <li>GLS Parcel Shop (online payment only)</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong>Online payments:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"product_tabs__containers_item_block\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0790/9218/7414/files/image_6.png\" alt=\"GoPay\" style=\"height:60px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/7988/1010/files/PayPo_logo_kolor.svg?v=1754574985\" alt=\"PayPo\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/7988/1010/files/visa_f5353cf6-3937-47e8-b0d0-4dffa5d38d04.svg?v=1754574037\" alt=\"Visa\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/7988/1010/files/mc_e03f8da5-c6a9-4429-bc4f-800d875497b5.svg?v=1754574036\" alt=\"Mastercard\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/7988/1010/files/apay_01efa87d-bab1-4df5-8583-9bd84c0efe6c.svg?v=1754575856\" alt=\"Apple Pay\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/7988/1010/files/gpay_763ff9ab-ac05-4efa-ae2a-34b490f1dbc2.svg?v=1754574037\" alt=\"Google Pay\">\n</div>\n\n<p><strong>Secure shopping:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Encrypted payments</li>\n  <li>Reliable logistics</li>\n  <li>Ongoing customer support</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Thank you for choosing a product made in Poland with a focus on quality and function. The driver's satisfaction is our highest priority.</p>",
            "hide_on_accessories": false
          }
        }
      },
